1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,180
W: Tom, isn't it about time that you should have heard something about your promotion?

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:08,295
It's been a couple of weeks since the boss first mentioned it to you, hasn't it?

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:12,530
M: The announcement will be posted on the company notice board after lunch today.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,580
I am starting to feel a bit nervous.

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,820
W: Yeah, I guess you would.

6
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:17,980
But you know what?

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,580
Don't worry too much.

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,680
I am certain that you will get the position.

9
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:27,420
I mean, realistically speaking, there isn't anyone in our office who can do the job that you do.

10
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,720
M: You are too kind.

11
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:32,080
Let's just hope that management feels the same way as you do.
